--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material bundled with this package
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

None. This distribution ships no code at all. It is the project's former name,
kept resolving on the package index, and it contains one thing: a dependency on
`vdi2770`, which is the same project under the name it uses now.

Everything this project bundles — VDI's XML schema, the IDTA document class
table, the reference implementation's corpus — is accounted for in the NOTICE
and THIRD_PARTY.md that ship with `vdi2770`.

The text of the VDI 2770 guideline itself (VDI 2770 Blatt 1:2020-04) is sold by
DIN Media and is NOT included, quoted, or paraphrased anywhere in this project.
